{"id":"word:hebrew:H6471","type":"word","title":"פַּעַם","subtitle":"H6471 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a stroke , literally or figuratively (in various applications, as follow)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to פַּעַם (H6471) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 118 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"פַּעַם (paʻam) means a stroke , literally or figuratively (in various applications, as follow) First listed occurrence: 1Chr 11 11."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"פַּעַם","transliteration":"paʻam","pronunciation":"pah'-am","strong":"H6471","lemmaId":"hebrew:H6471","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["פְּעָמִ֑ים","פְּעָמִ֖ים","פְּעָמִֽים","פְּעָמִ֔ים","פַּ֣עַם"],"morphs":[["HNcfpa",47],["HR/Ncfsa",14],["HTd/Ncfsa",13],["HNcfda",9],["HRd/Ncfsa",8],["HNcfsa",7],["HNcfpc/Sp3ms",6],["HNcfpc/Sp1cs",5],["HNcfsc",4],["HNcfpc",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"a stroke , literally or figuratively (in various applications, as follow)","usage":"anvil, corner, foot(-step), going, (hundred-) fold, × now, (this) once, order, rank, step, thrice, (often-), second, this, two) time(-s), twice, wheel.","full":"H6471. paam מַּ֫עַם 118 noun feminine Exod 8:28 (masculine only Judg 16:23 [text suspicious, see GFM Albr ZAW xvi (1896), 76 Kö synt. § 248m ], 2Sam 23:8 [Qr feminine], 1Kin 7:30 [corrupt, see below]) beat, foot, anvil, occurrence ; — absolute ׳מ Gen 2:23 +; מָּ֑עַם 46:30 +; dual מַּעֲמַיִם 27:36 +, etc.; plural מְּעָמִים 33:3 +; also (concrete) construct מַּעֲמֵי Judg 5:28 +; suffix מְּעָמַי Psa 57:7 ; 119:133 , etc.; מַּעֲמֹתָיו (only 1c ) Exod 25:12 2 t.; — 1. a. in poetry, hoof-beat Judg 5:28 ; late, of human footfall, footstep , figurative Psa 17:5 (|| אֲשׁוּרַי ), 119:113 ; מְּעָמָיו לְדֶרֶךְ וְיָשֵׂם Psalm 85:14. b. foot , figurative, Psa 57:7 ; 58:11 ; 74:3 ; 140:5 ; Prov 29:5 ; literal Isa 26:6 (|| רֶגֶל ), Cant 7:2; פ ׳בְּכַף 2Kin 19:24 = Isa 37:25 . c. foot , of ark Exod 25:12 ; 37:3 (P). — מַּעֲמֹתָיו 1Kin 7:30 read מִּנּוֺתָיו (compare 7:34 ). 2 = anvil (struck by hammer) Isa 41:7 . 3 occurrence, time (originally stroke, beat ): a. ׳מ אֶחָ֑ת [ אַחַת ] one time, once Josh 6:3 , 11 , 14 (JE), 10:42 (D) + 3 t. + 2Sam 23:8 Qr (&gt;Kt אחד ); מַּעֲמָ֑יִם twice Gen 41:32 6 t.; ׳פ Nahum 1:9 second time ; פ ׳אַרְבַּע Neh 6:4 four times ; פ שֵׁשׁ אוֺ ׳חָמֵשׁ 2Kin 13:19 , compare חֲמִישִׁית ׳מ Neh 6:5 ; also with שֶׁבַע שָׁלשׁ, , q. v.; פ ׳עֶשֶׂר ( וֶה ) Num 14:22 (JE) Neh 4:6 ; Job 19:3 , all indefinite = over and over; indefinite also וּשְׁתָּ֑יִם מַּעַם Neh 13:20 once and [i.e. or] twice ; שָׁלוֺשׁ מַּעֲמַיִם Job 33:29 twice (or) thrice ; פְעָמִים מֵאָה 2Sam 24:3 = 1Chr 21:3 , פ ׳אֶלֶף Deut 1:11 ; ׳פ רַבּוֺת Psa 106:43 ; Eccl 7:22 ; פְעָמִים עַדכַּֿמֶּה 1Kin 22:16 2Chr 18:15 . b. כְּפַעַםבְּֿפַעַם as time on time , i.e. as formerly, as usual, Num 24:1 (E) Judg 16:20 ; 20:30-31 , 1Sam 3:10 (compare Dr) 20:25 . c. בַּמַּעַם (גַּם) הַוּאֹת at this repetition (this time) also Exod 8:28 ; 9:14 (J) + 3 t.; בַּמּ ׳גַּם הַהִוא Deut 9:19 ; 10:10 . d. הַמַּעַם (Hexateuch only J): (1) = this once Gen 18:32 , הַמּ ׳אַךְ Exod 10:17 ; Judg 6:39 , ׳רַקהַֿמּ 6:39 , הַמּ ׳אַךְ הַזֶּה 16:28 ( הַזֶּה dubious, see above); (2) = now at lenth Gen 2:23 ; 29:34-35 , 30:20 ; 46:30 ; Judg 15:3 ; 16:18 , compare also Exod 9:27 now at length (it is clear that) I have sinned. e. מָּ֑עַם ֗֗֗ מַּעַם Prov 7:12 now ... now, at one time ... at another.","rootNote":"or (feminine) פַּעֲמָה ; from 6470 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 11 11","keyReferences":["1Chr 11 11","1Chr 21 3","1Kgs 7 4","1Kgs 7 5","1Kgs 7 30","1Kgs 9 25","1Kgs 11 9","1Kgs 17 21"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":118,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 11 11","book":"1Chr","chapter":11,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/פַ֥עַם","so